                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Sa..., sayoh a:mo nikmati ke:ní:w teh tik..., tehwa:tsi:n kox tikmahse:wa *o** a:mo ke:man tikmahse:wa.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
